<<npc "victoria" "trust" 5>>
<<objective "Leave Victoria's office.">>

<<sayself>>Yes, Ms. Cross.<</sayself>>

The words come out dry. Quiet. They taste like copper pennies.

<<say "Victoria Cross">>Good boy.<</say>>

Two words. They hit somewhere below my stomach and above my cock. A location I don't have a map for. A part of the body that medical textbooks don't chart because it only exists in moments like this, when someone with authority says something that shouldn't feel like what it feels like.

My face is burning. My neck is burning. The panties are a warm knot of silk in my fist. Something happens during the taking. Not in the moment itself. In the afterimage. I notice that my thumb is rubbing the silk. Back and forth. A small, unconscious motion. The way you rub a good luck charm or a stone you found on the beach. Not because you need to. Because it feels interesting.

I stop myself. Start again thirty seconds later.

The fabric is genuinely beautiful. I've never thought about underwear in those terms. Underwear is functional. Underwear is the thing beneath the thing. But this. The way the lace holds light. The way the silk changes temperature against skin. These were made by someone who understood that what touches you closest matters most.

I don't know what to do with that thought. So I carry it home in my pocket alongside the panties and I don't look at either until midnight.

